          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: यथा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यथा (yathā) — \"as, in the way that\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यथा (yathā) — \"as, in the way that\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You already say तथा, \"so, in that way\". यथा is its partner, and the two travel together: yathā... tathā, \"as... so\". Holding one of the pair, you now hold both."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said back to somebody on its own, it works as \"just so, as you say\" — an agreement rather than a description."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The other half of a pair you already had half of."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
