          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: केवलम्",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "केवलम् (kevalam) — \"only, merely\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "केवलम् (kevalam) — \"only, merely, nothing but\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Put it in front of what you are naming and it narrows the claim: केवलम् (kevalam) दुग्धम्, \"only milk\". It is the ordinary Sanskrit \"only\", not a poetic one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It also stands alone. Asked how much of a thing there is, केवलम् (kevalam) on its own is a complete and slightly rueful answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A word that narrows whatever it stands in front of."
            }
          ]
        },
